    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/db5be1e8725ea98607d8b5d5fd40ebf2.avif?t=1755703749\" data-has-big width=800 height=393 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly</strong>\u00a0around and\u00a0<strong>explore</strong> the island at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather</strong> seeds to <strong>replant</strong> the forests.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/fefdad23adb76b6f167a6d1f0cd1c215.poster.avif?t=1755703749\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/fefdad23adb76b6f167a6d1f0cd1c215.webm?t=1755703749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/fefdad23adb76b6f167a6d1f0cd1c215.mp4?t=1755703749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat</strong> and <strong>make friends</strong> with the locals - they might help you with clues and directions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hike</strong> up the hills and mountains to take in the view, and <strong>level up</strong>! Can you reach all the peaks?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/f15450fcc908456cf557f7e2294c6ce9.poster.avif?t=1755703749\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/f15450fcc908456cf557f7e2294c6ce9.webm?t=1755703749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/f15450fcc908456cf557f7e2294c6ce9.mp4?t=1755703749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There used to be ton of native flowers on the island. Are they all gone or just really well hidden?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to <strong>catch</strong> some worms for dinner while you\u2019re out and about!\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/WORMS.gif?t=1755703749\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/db5be1e8725ea98607d8b5d5fd40ebf2.avif?t=1755703749\" data-has-big width=800 height=393 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly</strong>\u00a0around and\u00a0<strong>explore</strong> the island at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather</strong> seeds to <strong>replant</strong> the forests.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/fefdad23adb76b6f167a6d1f0cd1c215.poster.avif?t=1755703749\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/fefdad23adb76b6f167a6d1f0cd1c215.webm?t=1755703749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/fefdad23adb76b6f167a6d1f0cd1c215.mp4?t=1755703749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat</strong> and <strong>make friends</strong> with the locals - they might help you with clues and directions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hike</strong> up the hills and mountains to take in the view, and <strong>level up</strong>! Can you reach all the peaks?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/f15450fcc908456cf557f7e2294c6ce9.poster.avif?t=1755703749\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/f15450fcc908456cf557f7e2294c6ce9.webm?t=1755703749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/f15450fcc908456cf557f7e2294c6ce9.mp4?t=1755703749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There used to be ton of native flowers on the island. Are they all gone or just really well hidden?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to <strong>catch</strong> some worms for dinner while you\u2019re out and about!\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/WORMS.gif?t=1755703749\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Revive the lost forests of the Isle of Trees in this cosy open-world game. Wander around, make friends, catch worms, and restore forests back to life! Dinner\u2019s at seven!",
